### ⚠️ ✅ clarity-cost-recalibration — Consensus PoC PR · **PoC landed**

`clarity::eval::pow` at `clarity/src/vm/functions/arithmetic.rs:312` · self_wall 240.0 ms · 400 calls · risk: Medium · 1 contributor(s)

**Evidence.** Throughput is gated on `runtime` axis; pow consumes ~30% of the binding budget per tx.

**Proposed.** Recalibrate the runtime cost weight for `pow` based on measured wall time.

**Outcome.** Recalibrated runtime weight for pow. Scoped tests passed.

Contributors: [throughput-only-family](../analysis/throughput-only-family/analysis.json)

Details: [experiment dir](../optimize/clarity-cost-recalibration/) · [target catalog](targets.md#clarity-cost-recalibration) · [implementation.md](../optimize/clarity-cost-recalibration/implementation.md)

---

### 📋 ✅ marf-layout-redesign — Consensus issue · **Routed to issue**

`marf::index_commit` at `stackslib/src/chainstate/stacks/index/storage.rs:201` · self_wall 540.0 ms · 1.2k calls · risk: High · 1 contributor(s)

**Evidence.** Index-commit phase concentrates on rewriting the trie root after each block.

**Proposed.** Restructure the on-disk MARF trie node layout to coalesce small writes.

Contributors: [marf-read-pattern](../analysis/marf-read-pattern/analysis.json)

Details: [experiment dir](../optimize/marf-layout-redesign/) · [target catalog](targets.md#marf-layout-redesign)

